  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>萃取機</h1>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1073717942014972034/RLib_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Lib\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1073717602880327761/1073717981118480535/RConfig_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Config\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fextractinator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>📖關於 📖</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><p>這個模組新增了一台名為萃取機的機器，能將廢棄方塊（如礫石和圓石）轉化為珍貴資源。其設計靈感源自《泰拉瑞亞》的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fterraria.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fExtractinator\" rel=\"nofollow\">淤泥萃取機</a>，融合了淤泥與雪泥礦石系統，並加入全新功能，包括全自動化運作、支援更多方塊類型，以及對其他模組的廣泛相容性。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fAlex\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1007383133294956627/1095009223462621294/BisectHosting_Banner_Alex_vector.svg\" alt=\"使用代碼「Alex」享 BisectHosting 75折優惠\" width=\"563\" height=\"103\"> </a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>",
